WEBVTT

00:00:28.216 --> 00:00:30.216
(Kraj bitboksovanja)

00:00:31.199 --> 00:00:32.353
Jeste li spremni?

00:00:32.377 --> 00:00:33.631
(Ovacije i aplauz)

00:00:33.655 --> 00:00:34.820
Jeste li spremni?

00:00:35.956 --> 00:00:37.356
Ed Kejdž: Da, da, tako je!

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:40.074
(Bitboksovanje)

00:00:43.357 --> 00:00:45.486
(Smeh)

00:00:45.486 --> 00:00:48.504
EK: Sviđa vam se? Da vam pokažem 
kako smo mi to nekad radili...

00:00:48.504 --> 00:00:49.691
NP: Samo napred, tata!

00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:51.730
EK: ...dok sam odrastao tokom devedesetih.

00:00:52.107 --> 00:00:53.869
(Bitboksovanje)

00:00:57.815 --> 00:00:59.815
(Kraj bitboksovanja)